WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.880
In the middle of a violent battle between
the Solo Ship and Daram's forces,

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:33.360
Cosmo had a duel with Gije.

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:40.160
However, Cosmo lost consciousness
 due to severe bleeding.

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:46.170
He continues sleeping without knowing
 that his girlfriend Kitty Kitten has been killed.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:52.630
<b>Deadly Fight - The Terror of Geru</b>

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.740
He's going to wake up eventually, right?

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.370
Cosmo's a strong person! He'll be alright!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.300
We've discovered the alien ship!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:23.590
That was surprisingly fast!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.350
This is a fine craft, after all.

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:31.730
Harulu prepared quite the efficient ship for us.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:35.360
The Heavy Mobile Mecha it
 was loaded with, Galbo Jick,

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.230
seems like an admiringly
 powerful weapon as well!

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.320
I'm confident we'll succeed.

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:42.030
It was developed to counter the Giant.

00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.220
Shall we put it into action right away?

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:50.620
After all, we're most likely
 being used as its testing team.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:53.670
I don't mind, if it can take down the Giant.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.540
Harulu has changed.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:57.150
Huh?

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:04.860
She's trying to express her feelings by handing
 out more resources than I expected.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.720
That's rather charming from a woman...

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:08.700
Yes...

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.060
Huh? Cosmo has awoken?!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:37.260
Kitty Kitten has died...

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:40.820
Why'd they even have to murder a civilian?!

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.550
Kitty Kitten?

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.220
She's a girl Cosmo met on Caral.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.740
It's enough that soldiers keep killing each other...

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.470
Isn't that right, Bes?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.430
Isn't that right, Sheryl?

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:57.400
Cosmo...

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:58.710
Dammit!

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.780
What are you doing, Cosmo?

00:05:01.890 --> 00:05:02.870
You need to get some rest!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.700
How can I rest?!

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:08.030
How can I?

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:08.680
Cosmo!

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:09.700
Go back to sleep!

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.600
Lotta, let him do as he likes.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:12.990
It's better that way.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:19.560
Damn it...

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:24.220
It's pathetic for a man to cry in public.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:25.690
It's pathetic!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.140
Just what do you know!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:30.350
You...!

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:33.720
Cosmo, don't vent your anger on her.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:36.690
Don't try to act smart, you sociopath!

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:37.830
Sociopath?

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.610
You're talking about me?

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.520
Cosmo! Don't say that!

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:42.610
It's fine, Lotta...

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:43.880
Sheryl...

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:46.150
That's just rude, Cosmo!

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:47.570
Get lost, kid!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.320
Cosmo!

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:51.700
Shut up already!

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.010
Cosmo...

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:54.620
Get a hold of yourself...

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.630
You can't put that back on!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:09.360
Cosmo...

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:12.050
Everyone is depending on you.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:16.980
We understand how you're feeling,
but you have to bear with it, Cosmo...

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.370
I know...

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:19.960
I know...

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:21.520
But I...

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:24.110
Couldn't even say goodbye to Kitty Kitten!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:24.960
Damn it!

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.150
Damn it!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:37.540
Cosmo?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:41.640
Cosmo!

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:42.690
Are you alright?

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:49.130
I can take care of myself. You don't have to worry.

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:51.010
Where are we heading to?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.050
Earth.

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:53.300
Earth?!

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:56.920
We can't defeat the enemy with 
Solo Ship's remaining manpower.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.560
We're going to contact the Space
 Union Military for reinforcements.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:03.270
And by going to Earth, I'll be able to research
the mysteries of the Sixth Civilization.

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:06.090
Have we shaken off the Buff Clan for good?

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.590
That's what I intend to do.

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:11.130
Besides, we now know the
 location of the Buff Clan planet.

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:12.810
If it comes down to it...

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:13.410
Huh?

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.700
Karala told us.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:17.200
But...

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.410
If we return to Earth...

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.580
I won't be able to avenge Kitten!

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.790
You shouldn't take this battle so personally!

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.260
A ship is chasing the Solo Ship.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.930
What!? Engine room!

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:33.470
Main engine to full power!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.890
We're going to shake off the pursuers!
 All hands, take your positions!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:36.820
The Buff Clan?

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:38.640
They still haven't given up?

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.490
Dammit!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.840
Are they trying to prevent us from reaching Earth?

00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:43.970
Do we have to take refuge at some planet again?

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.400
Don't leave your posts! Concentrate on work!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:53.880
Gross!

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.830
You can't take off in that condition...

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.660
Ah! Lou, stop it!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:12.050
How about we use the DS Brake?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:16.260
We could confirm whether
 the Buff Clan is chasing us or not.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:20.180
Wouldn't it be better to keep
 going and ask for help on Earth?

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.840
All the way to Earth?

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.100
We can't get our planet involved in this.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:25.930
We should fight them before going to Earth.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.610
Cosmo is right.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.400
Activating DS Brake!

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:34.330
It disappeared!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.700
The Logo Dau aliens' ship has
canceled its subspace flight!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:39.530
Examine the area they escaped to!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:41.850
Shall I head out?

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.950
Of course, get going.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:47.000
I think the aliens are being hastier than usual.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.670
Yes. I'll take the Galbo Jick.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:50.170
Good!

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:57.090
It's time to repay Harulu's feelings of gratitude!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.250
The enemy is coming!

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:16.010
In the direction of 4 o'clock!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.350
They'll enter missile firing range in three minutes!

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.310
Cosmo, it's impossible for you!

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:24.090
I can't stand back and watch
 while the enemy attacks.

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:26.670
I need to get revenge for Kitten!

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:30.870
You'll never win the battle if your
 eyes are clouded by personal grudges!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.190
I'll beat them!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.340
I'll beat them!

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.020
Deck...

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:49.270
Thanks.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:52.900
It's nothing.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.010
Sorry about what I said earlier.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.570
I liked Kitty Kitten too, you know.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.830
Thanks, Deck, I feel a bit better now.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:12.670
What is it, Cosmo?!

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:13.670
It's nothing!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.220
Can't you see, Cosmo?

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.180
Stay quiet, Deck.

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:23.410
But...

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.520
Don't let anyone know or they'll drop me off.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.850
Then I won't be able to take revenge.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.480
Got that? Just be quiet!

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.310
Yeah...

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.020
It's a promise between men.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.200
I get it. I'll be your eyes, Cosmo.

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:43.490
But I don't want to fight just for Kitty Kitten.

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:44.630
What?!

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.910
I'm fighting for everyone!

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:49.460
I'm fighting for all mankind!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.310
All right.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:55.640
I won't talk about Kitten anymore. I promise.

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:57.310
Let's go, Deck!

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.650
Yeah! It's a promise between men!

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.600
Sol Amber, change to Ideo-Delta!

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:09.270
Roger!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.360
Sol Vanier, change to Ideo-Nova!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.860
Sol Conver, change to Ideo-Buster!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.250
That Giant!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:40.430
You're in trouble if you think this Galbo Jick is
an ordinary Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:44.220
What's going on, Deck?

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.050
Where's the enemy coming from?

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.010
From one o'clock! It's pretty fast!

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:51.520
Cosmo, what are you doing? Dock!

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:52.580
I know!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:56.380
More to the right! Cosmo!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.690
Damn the Buff Clan!

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:20.000
Cosmo! What are you doing?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:21.560
I'm switching to the Glen Cannon!

00:12:21.620 --> 00:12:22.970
Go ahead, Techno!

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:24.510
Yeah. Here they come!

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:27.130
What's Cosmo doing? The enemy's coming!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.680
Deck! Please! The enemy's too far away!

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.060
In front, coming from slightly below us.

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:37.810
Okay!

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.750
Glen Cannon!

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:04.590
In front of us! It's big, Cosmo!

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:06.570
Roll over!

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:10.970
Did we do it?!

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.220
I think you hit it, but...

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.350
Okay! Stop them!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.480
We won't go down that easily!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.570
That's good team play!

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:28.410
Retreat! We should use this moment to dock!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.950
Deck! We're docking!

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.160
Roger! Docking mark...

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:34.370
There!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:35.750
Okay! Docking!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.580
Roger!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.710
They're forming the Giant? Spread out the Geru Field!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.130
Roger! Galbo Units 2 and 3, hurry!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:02.040
What's wrong, Deck?

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.420
The enemy...!

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:10.810
That's an Anti-ldeon Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:14.800
You must be right! Are they trying
 to engage us in close combat?

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:18.160
The three Heavy Mobile Mecha
 have become a single unit!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.960
What's the enemy planning?

00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:24.340
Could it be a Heavy Mobile
Mecha built to counter the Ideon?

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:26.620
It couldn't have been that simple to develop!

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.140
They went and combined into one?!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:33.810
What are they thinking?!

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.700
Cosmo, back away! We need to gain some distance!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.080
Don't let them get away!

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:54.610
Unless we force them into close combat,
 we can't spread the Geru Field!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.000
We can't give them cover fire!

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:00.040
Damn that Cosmo! Why isn't he backing off?

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.130
Hatari, turn to the left!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.630
We'll shoot you down!

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:13.760
Are they using us as a shield?

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.720
Damn Giant!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.810
The Galbo Jick is in close combat.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:26.480
That Gije...

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:32.200
He must be testing the Giant's close combat
  capabilities, but this can't keep up for long...

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.240
The Galbo Jick's power still isn't quite enough.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.740
Is he going to be alright, Sir Daram?

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:39.660
That's not all this new weapon can do!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:47.000
Fire the mind-breaking beam, Geru Field!

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:47.670
Yes sir!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:48.960
The Geru Field?

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:49.650
That's right...

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:53.120
Think of it as a beam cannon that destroys brain cells.

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.500
We've developed such a thing?

00:15:55.500 --> 00:16:00.310
We have proof that the power of Ide
 is called forth by people's thoughts.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:04.650
Therefore, we only have to lower
 that Giant's fighting power.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:09.450
If we target the pilots' brains, we can
take the Giant without damaging it.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:26.750
What's that light?!

00:16:34.150 --> 00:16:35.610
My head! My head!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.670
What is this? Why do I have
 a headache all of a sudden?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.850
Only five more minutes...

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:49.610
Bes!

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.360
The Ideon has stopped moving!

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:52.940
Cosmo! Cosmo!

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:54.700
Answer me! What's wrong?

00:16:58.490 --> 00:16:59.620
What could it be?

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.080
The brainwaves of the Ideon
pilots are being disrupted!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:03.790
Their brain waves?

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:04.870
Solo Ship!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:07.250
Get closer to the Ideon! We've got to rescue it!

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.170
Don't let the alien ship get near the Giant!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:26.140
Karala, don't you recognize
 that Heavy Mobile Mecha?

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.180
I'm not familiar with it.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.650
And that light...

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:30.290
Get closer to the Ideon!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.880
The Buff Clan must know about the Ide!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.120
What'd you say?

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:44.080
That light is an anti-Ideon weapon.

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:47.830
So they discovered the secret of
 Ide and developed that weapon?

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:51.340
The Buff Clan keeps sending
 new weapons one after another...

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.050
How can we ever win against them?!

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.550
All right! Cover the Galbo Jick!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:13.230
Kitten!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.740
Kitten! Kitten!

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:27.160
Deck! Deck, are you alright?

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:28.410
Deck!

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.460
You can't beat me!

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:36.800
It's that thing right in front of us!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:42.070
Deck, give me a hand! Deck!

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:43.110
Damn you!

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.850
Deck! What's the enemy doing?

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:53.980
That weird light is getting weaker.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:55.690
Okay!

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:04.740
Dodge!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.130
Get back in position immediately!

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:17.340
The headache's gone!

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.300
Now!

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:20.880
Cosmo, Kasha, return the Ideon to the ship!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:21.880
Return?

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.010
Hurry up!

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:24.180
But...

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.390
I'll take my revenge!

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:26.530
Cosmo!

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:39.360
They're running away?

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.200
Short DS Drive!

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:45.910
Short DS Drive?

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:49.640
We'll enter DS Drive for a short period
 to avoid being detected by sensors.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:50.290
Roger!

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:51.330
Joliver!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.620
Take the main engine to full power!

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:53.580
Roger!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.800
They're transferring to subspace flight?

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.430
Shoot the biosensors at it!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:20.150
As long as the biosensors stay attached...

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:24.320
we can find them even if they
 run to the end of the universe!

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:25.780
Target, Earth!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:26.700
Earth?!

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:28.550
Align the coordinates, quickly!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.900
Align the coordinates! We're going to Earth!

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:33.230
Earth!

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:34.230
Earth...

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.540
The coordinates have been set!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.840
X, Y, all axes are have been set!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:39.820
Okay!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:41.300
DS Brake!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:17.830
Earth...

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:19.630
We've come back!

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.800
That's Earth!

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:23.760
It's Earth!

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:26.380
Our home planet.

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:30.600
That's...

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.430
Earth!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:32.740
Earth...

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.060
Your home planet.

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:36.940
It's your new home planet now.

00:21:37.850 --> 00:21:38.940
From now on,

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:41.460
if you ever think of returning
to the Buff Clan for a moment,

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:44.360
I'll have no choice but to kill you.

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:45.190
Bes...

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:48.600
It looks the same as the Earth I knew.

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:51.830
I can get used to it.

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:01.870
At last... We're free from all the fighting.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.490
That's right.

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:07.790
They'll let us off the Solo Ship once we get to Earth.

00:22:07.870 --> 00:22:09.750
Aren't you fine with that?

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:10.640
But...

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:13.220
I won't be able to avenge Kitten...

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:14.930
Cosmo!

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:18.310
I'm sorry.

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:26.360
Open a line to the staff officer headquarters!

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:35.500
The lush and vibrant homeworld of Cosmo
 and the others slowly grows nearer.

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:41.700
The Solo Ship sends a message to Earth,
 their hearts trembling with anticipation.

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:53.680
<i>With the Earth right before their
eyes, the Solo Ship is rejected.</i>

00:22:54.390 --> 00:22:59.810
<i>A lone sympathizer, Colbock,
infiltrates the Moon Base with Sheryl.</i>

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:03.510
<i>However, Colbock is brought
 down by an Earthling's bullet.</i>

00:23:04.480 --> 00:23:08.360
<i>Can Sheryl manage to escape alone and
 bring back the new information on the Ide?</i>

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:14.380
